pe":"text","value":" 表示发电机两极板间的电压，求输出电流 "},{"type":"math","value":"I"},{"type":"text","value":" 与 "},{"type":"math","value":"U"},{"type":"text","value":" 的关系．（此小题可变电阻阻值 "},{"type":"math","value":"R"},{"type":"text","value":" 不可用）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/cfa850b2dd89012cd8be80c24161dbde08030ce9e5d1a463b6a268d21e2e4c75.png","width":662,"height":390,"width_mm":77.671,"row_group":"xinzhendi-lianmeng-2410-q20-row1"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"20.（1）"},{"type":"math","value":"qvB=\\frac{U}{a}q"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"E=U=Bva"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）上极板电势高于下极板（1分）\n（2）闭合开关后，"},{"type":"math","value":"r=\\rho\\frac{a}{bl}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）形成向上的电流"},{"type":"math","value":"I=\\frac{E}{R+r}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n对电流受力分析"},{"type":"math","value":"BIa = \\Delta pS"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）其中"},{"type":"math","value":"S = ab"},{"type":"text","value":"\n联立得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta p = \\frac{B^{2}va}{Rb + \\rho\\frac{a}{l}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n（3）方法一：\n两板间电场强度为"},{"type":"math","value":"E = \\frac{U}{a}"},{"type":"text","value":"，配速"},{"type":"math","value":"v = v_{1} + v_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，其中"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1} = \\frac{E}{B} = \\frac{U}{Ba}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n与电场力相抵消"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{2} = v - v_{1} = v - \\frac{U}{Ba}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）做"},{"type":"math","value":"R = \\frac{mv_{2}}{qB} = \\frac{m}{qB}\\left(v - \\frac{U}{Ba}\\right)"},{"type":"text","value":"圆周运动（1分）\n①当"},{"type":"math","value":"R < \\frac{a}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，即"},{"type":"math","value":"U > Bav - \\frac{qB^{2}a^{2}}{2m}"},{"type":"text","value":"时\n与极板距离小于"},{"type":"math","value":"2R"},{"type":"text","value":"的粒子可以打到极板而形成电流，单位时间内打到一块极板上的粒子数为"},{"type":"math","value":"N = 2Rbnv"},{"type":"text","value":"此时发电机的输出电流为"},{"type":"math","value":"I = Nq = \\frac{2bmnv}{B}\\left(v - \\frac{U}{Ba}\\right)"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n②当"},{"type":"math","value":"R \\geq \\frac{a}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，即"},{"type":"math","value":"U \\leq Bav - \\frac{qB^{2}a^{2}}{2m}"},{"type":"text","value":"时\n全部入射粒子均可击中极板，故此时发电机的输出电流为"},{"type":"math","value":"I = nqabv"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n方法二：\n假设粒子进入后，竖直方向偏移"},{"type":"math","value":"y"},{"type":"text","value":"距离恰好打到板上\n"},{"type":"math","value":"-qU\\frac{y}{a}=\\frac{1}{2}m(v'^{2}-v^{2})"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"-qBy=m(v'-v)"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n可得"},{"type":"math","value":"y=\\frac{2m}{qB}\\left(v-\\frac{U}{Ba}\\right)"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n①当"},{"type":"math","value":"y < a"},{"type":"text","value":"，即"},{"type":"math","value":"U > Bav - \\frac{qB^{2}a^{2}}{2m}"},{"type":"text","value":"时\n"},{"type":"math","value":"I=Nq=\\frac{2bmnv}{B}\\left(v-\\frac{U}{Ba}\\right)"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n②当"},{"type":"math","value":"y \\geq a"},{"type":"text","value":"，即"},{"type":"math","value":"U \\leq Bav - \\frac{qB^{2}a^{2}}{2m}"},{"type":"text","value":"时"},{"type":"math","value":"I = nqabv"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"}]}}]}
